    <Placemark>
      <name>free@last </name>
      <description><![CDATA[Warm hub without food offer<br><br>Opening times<br>- Coffee morning - Thursdays 11am - 12pm<br>- Stay and Play - Fridays 1-3pm, Term Time only<br><br>Other youth activities on offer; visit Facebook page for details: <br><br>https://www.facebook.com/freeatlast.nechells<br>www.freeatlast.co.uk<br><br>Contact:<br>Tel: 0121 327 5959<br>Email: info@freeatlast.co.uk<br><br>Address:<br>49 Nechells Park Rd<br>Nechells<br> Birmingham<br> B7 5PR<br><br>[Feb 25]]]></description>
