    <Placemark>
      <name>Newbigin Community Trust @ Windsor Olympus Academy</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Warm hub without food offer<br><br>Opening hours:<br>Tuesday - Thursday, 10am to 2pm<br><br>Activities including crafts, art, cooking, sewing, sports, ESOL, knitting, crochet, and coffee morning - Women Only<br><br>Advocacy support with forms, CVs, benefits, letters, school matters, housing - open to everyone<br><br>Contact<br>Phone: 07899 104960<br>Email: wiam@newbiginhouse.uk<br><br>Website: https://www.newbigintrust.uk/<br><br>Services<br>Accessible entrance<br>Free Wi-fi<br>Charging facilities for phones and other devices<br>Refreshments such as hot drinks, cordial and biscuits<br>Activities for example cooking classes, arts and crafts or physical activity<br><br>Address<br>Newbigin Community Hub at Windsor Olympus Academy<br>Perrot Street<br>Birmingham<br>B18 4LX<br><br>[Feb 26]]]></description>
