      <name>Newbigin Community Trust @ Newbigin House</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Warm hub without food offer<br><br>Opening hours<br>Monday  - Wednesday, 9:00am to 1:00pm<br>Thursday, 9:00am to 3:00pm<br><br>Contact<br>Phone: 07769 036498<br>Email: info@newbiginhouse.uk<br><br>Website: https://newbigintrust.uk/<br><br>Services<br>Accessible entrance<br>Free Wi-fi<br>Charging facilities for phones and other devices<br>Hot drinks, cordial and biscuits<br>TV<br>Library corner/facilities<br>Toilets including accessible toilets and baby-changing facilities<br>Activities<br>Play equipment<br>Outdoor spaces/activities<br><br>Address<br>28 Handsworth New Road<br>Winson Green<br>Birmingham<br>B18 4PT<br><br>[Feb 26]]]></description>
