    <Placemark>
      <name>Newbigin Community Trust @ Lodge Road Church Centre URC</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Warm Hub with food offer via community café <br><br>Opening hours: Tuesday to Friday, 10am to 2pm,<br>Sunday, 10am to 1pm<br>These may be flexible depending on need. <br><br>Community Cafe Tuesday - Friday, low cost £2<br>Community Lunch on Sunday<br>Contact  info@newbiginhouse.uk<br><br>Services<br>Accessible entrance<br>Free Wi-Fi<br>Free use of computers and other devices<br>Charging facilities for phones and other devices<br>Refreshments such as hot drinks, cordials, and biscuits<br>Warm food<br>Toilets, including accessible toilets and baby-changing facilities<br>Magazines and newspapers<br>Library facilities<br>Book borrowing and swapping<br>Outdoor spaces and activities<br>Activities such as knit and natter, music groups, blacksmithing and art groups<br><br>Lodge Road Church Centre URC,<br>143/4 Lodge Road,<br>Birmingham,<br>B18 5BU<br><br>[Feb 26]]]></description>
