    <Placemark>
      <name>Love Your Neighbour
</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Warm hub with food offer<br>• There are charges for food and drinks, these may be able to be provided free of cost at the discretion of the LYN team<br><br>Opening times:<br>Monday - Thursday: 9am to 4pm<br>Friday: Midday to 4pm<br><br>•	Charging facilities for phones and other devices<br>•	Hot drinks, cordial and biscuits<br>•	Warm Food<br>•	Food Bank<br>- Food Pantry<br>- Book borrowing/swap<br>- Toilets including accessible toilets and baby changing facilities<br>- Play equipment<br>- Car parking<br>- Free Craft Club (Tuesday)<br>- Free English Conversation classes (Monday evening)<br>- Free support for children with SEND and their families<br><br>Contact:<br>01218205618<br>loveyourneighbour@gasstreet.church<br><br>St Luke’s (Gas Street),<br>Great Colmore St,<br>Ladywood,<br>Birmingham,<br>B15 2AT<br><br>[Dec 25]]]></description>
