    <Placemark>
      <name>Birmingham City Mission Care Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Warm hub with food offer<br><br>Open Monday - Thursday 10:30am - 3pm<br>Contact: <br>Email philansell@birminghamcitymission.co.uk or carecentre@birminghamcitymission.co.uk or call on 0121 289 2894<br><br>Services<br>- Charging facilities for phones and other devices<br>- Hot drinks, cordial and biscuits<br>- Warm food, Lunch served at 12:30pm, dessert at 1pm<br>- Food bank<br>- Toilets<br>- Disabled Toilets<br>- Shower facilities<br> <br>Activities include:<br>- Running in the afternoons<br>- A ukulele group<br>- Bible study<br>- Arts and crafts group.<br><br>Birmingham City Mission Care Centre<br>8-10 Washington Street<br>Birmingham<br>B1 1JR<br><br> [Feb 26]]]></description>
