      <description><![CDATA[Warm hub with food offer<br><br>Opening hours:<br>- Place of welcome: Wednesday, 10am -  midday<br>- Knit and Natter for people over 50: Friday 11am to 1pm<br>- Every 6 weeks: Saturday coffee morning and breakfast, 11am - 1pm. For dates contact office: 0121-766-7803.<br><br>Free internet access<br>Free use of devices<br>Charging facilities for phones and other devices<br>Work stations<br>Refreshments such as hot drinks, cordials, and biscuits<br>Food pantry<br>Magazines and newspapers<br>Toilets, including accessible toilets and baby-changing facilities<br>Shower facilities<br>Children's play equipment<br>Outdoor spaces and activities<br>Somewhere to park your car<br>Activities such as arts and crafts, knitting, crochet, and artwork<br><br>14 Jenkins Street,<br>Small Heath,<br>Birmingham,<br>B10 0QH<br><br>[May 25]]]></description>
