    <Placemark>
      <name>As-Suffa Foodbank</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Foodbank - referral by professional e.g. GP, School etc. or via a recognised referral partner organisation only<br><br>All our food parcels are sufficient to feed an average size family for one week. Our parcels include non-perishable goods like pasta, UHT milk, canned soups, etc.<br><br>Tuesday and Friday (Foodbank delivery of parcels). <br><br>Contact: Ruksana Begum, Community Coordinator<br>Email: Ruksana.Begum@as-suffa.org<br>Tel: +44 (0) 7521 163 741<br>Working hours<br>Tuesday and Thursday 9:30 -2:30<br>Wednesday 9:00- 2:00<br>Alternate contact: info@as-suffa.org; tel: 0121 285 2777<br>https://as-suffa.org/community/food-bank/<br><br>Address:<br> As-Suffa Institute,<br>156 High Street, <br>Birmingham<br>B6 4UX<br><br>[Feb 26]]]></description>
