      <name>Time Out After School Club - Food Aid 
</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Foodbank - voucher needed/referral only<br><br>Wednesdays -10am-13:00pm<br><br>We run on a referral scheme, if the referee calls let us know who’s coming. We’ll email over a referral form the person will need to bring it with them. Bring proof of ID.<br><br>Contact:<br>Judith<br>timeoutafterschoolclub@hotmail.com<br>0121 328 3399<br><br>80 Nechells Park Road, Birmingham<br>B7 5PR<br><br>[Feb 26]]]></description>
