      <name>Love Your Neighbour Foodbank</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Emergency Food parcels - referral only<br><br>Opening Hours: Wednesday 11 - 2pm<br>Delivery sometimes available<br><br>Able to offer doorstep deliveries to those who would struggle to visit the Foodbank in person. You need a voucher or a referral to access the food bank. You can get one from an agency or care professional, or contact the team on 0121 820 5618.<br><br>Address:<br>Gas Street St Luke’s<br>Great Colmore Street<br>Birmingham<br> B15 2AT<br><br>[Jan 24]]]></description>
