    <Placemark>
      <name>Birmingham Care Group (BCG) Food Pantry</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Pantry/low cost food<br><br>Tuesday - Thursday 11am - 1pm<br><br>£15 annual membership<br>£5 per shop, max 2 shops per week per member.<br>Register membership in person at pantry.<br>Membership card will be given once registered and must be presented when attending pantry in order to shop<br>https://www.birminghamcaregroup.org/<br>For more information, please contact Rani Ramdeen on:<br>Rani@birminghamcaregroup.org<br>01215239690<br><br>Unit 5 Magreal Industrial Estate, B16 0QZ<br><br>Examples of food available, all subject to availability:<br>Fresh fruit & veg<br>Dairy products<br>Ready meals<br>Fresh & frozen meat & poultry - limited halal meat & fish<br>Fresh bread<br>Caribbean grocery items<br><br>Free Sanitary towels with each shop<br>Various toiletries & household products available subject to availability<br><br>[Sep 25]]]></description>
