    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[The Community Shop - Love Your Neighbour (Gas Street St Luke's Church)]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Thursdays 9am - 11am<br>Tickets sold from 8:30am. <br><br>To be eligible for The Community Shop you must live within a 1.6km radius of Gas Street St Luke’s Church building and be in receipt of means-tested benefits. To become a member visit www.gasstreet.church/communityshopmembership<br><br>£4.50 for items including meat and veg; free tea/coffee while you wait. <br>loveyourneighbour@gasstreet.church<br>0121 820 5618<br><br>Address:<br>Great Colmore St<br>Birmingham<br> B15 2AT<br><br>[Dec 25]]]></description>
