    <Placemark>
      <name>Nechells POD Food Pantry</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Open access/no referral required<br><br>Thursdays 1-2pm<br><br>Open to all residents in B7 postcode and regular participants of Nechells POD.  Need proof of address from last 3 months. Need to bring own <br>*ID required on first visit*<br><br>£3 for up to £20 worth of shopping. Same family twice per month. <br><br>Income maximisation and welfare support also available<br><br>Contact:<br>Chantelle Henry<br>chantelle.henry@nechellspod.co.uk<br>0121 681 2173<br><br>Nechells POD, 28 Oliver Street, Nechells, Birmingham, B7 4NX<br><br>[Dec 25]]]></description>
