    <Placemark>
      <name>Birmingham Vineyard Church Bags of Hope</name>
      <description><![CDATA[A food provision for agencies and social services - If you are an agency worker enquiring about emergency food assistance for a client, please contact the foodbank team on: <br>bagsofhope@birminghamvineyard.com<br><br>We only operate on office times (9am - 5pm) on weekdays but if it is an emergency, we can give out after a service on Sunday.<br><br>If you are an individual in need of emergency food assistance, or if you have a support worker of any kind, they are the best place to go first as we provide our food parcels to agencies to give out. If they cannot help you, in some cases we are able to provide emergency food parcels. Contact the Bag of Hope team to see if there is availability: bagsofhope@birminghamvineyard.com<br><br>[Jan 26] ]]></description>
