      <name>Karis Baby Bank</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Baby Bank - referral only, appointment only for collection on Friday afternoon<br><br>For families with babies and infants who are facing hardship and/or crisis which means they need help with essentials for their baby. This provision is based on referrals from other organisations and groups who are well placed to assess the need and identify what items families need, this includes social workers, children’s centres, health workers and other charities.<br><br>For more information, call main office on <br>0121 455 7524 or email babybank@karisneighbourscheme.org<br><br><br>Address<br>c/o Church of the Redeemer<br> Parker Street (off Monument Road)<br> Monument Rd<br> B16 8UU<br><br>[Feb 26]]]></description>
