    <Placemark>
      <name>Armada FC Community Food Parcel Service</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Food bank - open access/no voucher or referral required.<br><br>Open 7 days a week<br><br>We deliver across the Birmingham region – book your delivery slot today: https://forms.gle/zT7zvGGr2YEXAy8q8<br><br>Armada FC provides free food parcels to individuals and families across Birmingham, ensuring no one goes without essentials. Our service includes a home delivery option, with priority given to people who are wheelchair dependent or have medical conditions that make it difficult to collect food supplies in person.<br>There is no judgment – only support. Whether it’s for you or a loved one, Armada FC is here to help make life a little easier.<br><br>Contact Shahid Khan<br>- Email: info@armadafc.co.uk<br>- Mob: 07400331233<br><br>www.armadafc.co.uk<br><br>Address:<br>Calthorpe Pavilion<br>257 Edward Road<br> Birmingham<br> B12 9LF<br><br>[Jan 26]]]></description>
